  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbt/sbt/tarball/v2.0.10",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbt/sbt/zipball/v2.0.10",
  "body": "## changes with compatibility implications\r\n\r\n- `sbt` runner script honors `JAVA_HOME` environment variable by @anatoliykmetyuk in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9825\r\n\r\n## 🚀 updates\r\n\r\n- deps: Updates to Coursier 2.1.26, and sets user agent header by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9784, https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9852, https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9786 and https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9818\r\n\r\n## 🐛 bug fixes\r\n\r\n- fix: Removes write permission from the CAS to prevent cache corruption by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9847\r\n- fix: Implements copy-on-write for symlinks by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/io/pull/568\r\n- fix: Restores the pipelining early output on an action-cache hit by @PhoenixmitX in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9793\r\n- fix: Reads scripted `pause` from standard input by @anatoliykmetyuk in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9824\r\n- fix: Keeps the interrupt flag when writing to the thin client by @pierscin and @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9848 / https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9855\r\n\r\n## behind the scenes\r\n\r\n- deps: Updates to Gigahorse 0.9.6 by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9775\r\n- deps: IO 1.13.4 by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9847\r\n- deps: sbtn 2.1.0-6eac8efa by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9861\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sbt/sbt/compare/v2.0.9...v2.0.10",
